6.2 Implementation and Evaluation
We implement SnarkMux in Rust3 based on Nova’s implemention [22]. We use
the BN254/Grumpkin cycle for recursion, and evaluate aggregation for Groth16
and Plonk instantiated over BN254. We instantiate Hash with Poseidon at 128-
bit security [15]. The final SNARK SNARK′ in the IVC is Spartan [23]. All
experiments run on an Intel i7-12700KF CPU (3.6 GHz) with 32 GB RAM.
